      },
      "text": "EXTERNAL WORLD:\n  ─ The physical world is filtered through consciousness.\n  ─ What we \"see\" is inseparable from how we see it.\n  ─ (Phenomenology: Husserl; psychology: William James)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-MODERNISM.md#006",
      "path": [
        "06-MODERNISM.md"
      ],
