      "text": "LITERARY RESPONSE:\n  ─ Stream of consciousness (Joyce, Woolf)\n  ─ Multiple unreliable perspectives (Faulkner, Woolf)\n  ─ Time dissolved and reconstructed (Proust)\n  ─ Parable and nightmare-logic (Kafka)\n  ─ The encyclopedic novel that digests all of modernity (Mann, Musil)\n```"
